 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF6-WARDEN-LAYER-ALPHA.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-AL                  FLOAT-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 L-OUT.
    05 L-O                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-IN L-OUT.
     MOVE 0 TO L-O(1) L-O(2)
     IF L-I(5) = 0
         EVALUATE L-I(1)
             WHEN 1
                 MOVE 1 TO WS-AL
             WHEN 2
                 COMPUTE WS-AL = FUNCTION COS(L-I(2) * 0.045) * 0.25
             WHEN 3
                 COMPUTE WS-AL = FUNCTION COS(L-I(2) * 0.045 + 3.1415927) * 0.25
             WHEN 4
                 MOVE L-I(3) TO WS-AL
             WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE L-I(4) TO WS-AL
         END-EVALUATE
         IF WS-AL < 0
             MOVE 0 TO WS-AL
         END-IF
         IF WS-AL > 0.00001
             MOVE 1 TO L-O(1)
             MOVE WS-AL TO L-O(2)
         END-IF
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF6-WARDEN-LAYER-ALPHA.




