 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF6W-ANIM-APPLY.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-DOK                  BINARY-LONG.
 COPY CLEM5.
 COPY CLEM2.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
